+//!   per the `05` §6.8 guard/floor conventions, integer representation
+//!   fields passed through exactly (ADR-0005), grouped vectors via
+//!   integer regroup of quantized per-window values (`05` §6.7), and the
+//!   f64 spectrum (mutated by the reused TNS) passed through unchanged.
+//!   Invariant guards (`05` §8): finite values, non-negative energies /
+//!   thresholds, saturating clamps, Ld sentinel/floor, grouped stride
+//!   layout; a non-finite value is a loud frame-level finding via the
+//!   existing skip-with-note path, never silent.
